Se você tem diabetes, este é o aplicativo com a maior variedade de ferramentas para o seu dia-a-dia.

Explore todos os recursos disponíveis e ainda tenha em conjunto o acompanhamento do seu médico!

Principais recursos:
- Contagem de carboidratos;
- Diário de glicemias;
- Geração de relatórios;
- Tabela de alimentos atualizada;
- Possibilidade de cadastro de novos alimentos;
- Cálculo de insulina bolus de correção e refeição
- Personalização da dose de insulin com seta de tendência conforme a terapia utilizada;
- Acesso de dados e relatórios diretamente pela equipe médica;

Responsável médico: Dr. Rodrigo Siqueira, CRM 7481-3 RJ, PhD em endocrinologia, fundador do Centro de Diabetes e da Colônia Azul Diabetes Rio, um dos maiores especialistas em diabetes e tecnologias em diabetes no Brasil.

CTO: Pablo Silva, analista de sistemas, professor e jornalista. 
Diabético Tipo 1 e fundador do Canal Eu e a Bete e grupo Insulina do Amor.

Antes de utilizar o aplicativo ou tomar qualquer decisão médica, busque um médico especializado.
O iGlicho é compatível com Accu-chek e Accu-chek Guide que possui licença de uso no Brasil e Portugal.

Pills Time is a personal pharmacy assistant and one of the most convenient medication reminders. You won't forget to take your medicine – our pill reminder will send you a notification! Now improve your health and quickly defeat any disease is much easier.

Make your medication schedule in accordance with the instructions or recipe given to you by your doctor. Flexible configuration will help you to defer or postpone a regular pill intake. Your courses will be archived, so you can return to them as needed!

Our advantages:
- The schedule for the day, week, month;
- Courses by number of medications;
- Taking medicine daily, every few days, weeks, months;
- Any duration and repetition rates;
- Automatic calculation of the remaining medicine;
- The opportunity to save the current medication;
- History of medication doses directly in the calendar.
- Your own database of medicines, pills and vitamins.

Take care of your health – and Pills Time will help you with this!

Stork guides you through pregnancy day-by-day and week-by-week. Based on your due date, you will receive personalized information, the latest parenting news, and health information. 
You will get tools to help you prepare and feel in control every step of the way – helping you achieve a happy, healthy pregnancy.

To get started, simply enter your baby's due date. All health content is based on information from experts, so you can feel confident and prepared for the changes to your baby and body. 

Explore helpful pregnancy tools like baby size and weight visualizer, contraction timer, pregnancy weight chart, hospital bag list, and newborn shopping list. 

Feature highlights:
- A social network for pregnant women;
- Daily and weekly pregnancy info;
- Beautiful images;
- Personal diary;
- Notes;
- Pregnancy weight log and chart;
- Contraction timer;
- Hospital bag list;
- Newborn shopping list;
- Baby size and weight visualizer;
- Mother's abdomen photos;
- Pregnancy week by week info;
- Articles, tips, and tools;
- And much more!

